<title>USA: ShopKo Stores Inc Q1 shr increases.</title>
<headline>ShopKo Stores Inc Q1 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net			  7,238		    5,759</p>
<p> Revs		     723,811		  614,742</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  32,767		   32,431</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 1997 includes a one-time, pre-tax charge of $2.8 million, or $0.05 per share, for costs incurred in connection with the business combination agreement with Phar-Mor Inc, which was terminated on April 2, 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
